  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unit de Lutte pour la Sant (ULS) will work to reduce infant and maternal mortality by increasing the outreach of its public health campaigns, improving living conditions through microcredit, training traditional birth attendants (TBAs), and providing primary care in six communities: Calvaire Jouissant, Lorier, Cormier, Celicour, Haud Marchand et Janvier, in the Bande du Nord. The project will benefit 6,000 residents directly and 15,000 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
